Z||000000||sparks||04-06-2001||09:48 AM||||He sent me free headlight buckets!!!!<P>No charge at all for shipping, parts or anything.<P>My driver's side is broken due to an accident I had back in Jan. the hood and fender are broken and caused the bucket to break when I opened the hood with the light up.  So I asked about a week ago if the buckets were the same on 3rd Gen Firebirds as Fieros.  DXR Dad emailed me and asked if I just needed the buckets and no motors.  Yes, that was all.  Day later I had an email that they were on the way!!<P>Got them yesterday, when I asked him how much I owed him, he told me it was free of charge!<P>So this is my public thanks DXR_Dad, you're awesome!<P>------------------<P>Adam Sparks<p>[This message has been edited by sparks (edited 04-06-2001).]||||reg||10
